ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KJgxyjQwLiwQ7kNvwFE5uGs&_nc_oc=AdqCsAYTZxPVJKnUC2IcCZJzwestz1xolvlaviweQqUMtWgcd7cYnzLfv2ZpTtjI5W4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSAHnOeJS_huucRc8eBowSoVEqWGT7z21Uo9fHE8UKWXA&oe=6AFF0A56"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xBIXi0zSrKcQ7kNvwE7Vebu&_nc_oc=AdpnuNMtscMGbNusEeFjqHUWNqFBGeVYocwvGCPgQMLsMENRaV8L_wj6OERgnh1vtqE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR6Z_3wf1kqrl8EdjRcGIGbtDunJR9F56EVChDhe06qMw&oe=6AFF0DDC"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v2HtBwRYlmwQ7kNvwEFciaE&_nc_oc=AdouvXWzyTwLfafgjhQv4vRzIbpAVAC4FtX8wEQG31c3yIQi8dwuMyQHR0bwzefhFg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRc7imsb5WIpzKel344QBh7S6Uw_vHDgz-m30qwR7co-Q&oe=6AFF275B"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486